{"type":"message","id":"2e5aa9f6","parentId":"95403384","timestamp":"2026-02-02T03:28:28.856Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a fun, creative morning surprise for Doug (Telegram user 7009773128). This should be something delightful and unexpected — NOT work-related, NOT about his projects. Think entertainment, humor, or something genuinely cool.\n\nHere's what you should build:\n\nCreate an interactive \"Doug's Sunday Morning Arcade\" — a retro-styled mini game collection as a single HTML page. Include:\n\n1. A quick reaction-time game (click targets as fast as you can)\n2. A simple snake or breakout-style game  \n3. A trivia challenge with fun/weird facts\n\nStyle it retro arcade — neon colors, pixel fonts (use Google Fonts \"Press Start 2P\"), dark background, CRT scanline effect, coin-insert animations. Make it feel like walking into an arcade in 1987.\n\nRequirements:\n- Single self-contained HTML file (inline CSS + JS, no external deps except Google Fonts)\n- Save to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/morning-arcade/index.html\n- Create a simple express server at /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/morning-arcade/server.js on port 3950\n- Start it with PM2 as \"morning-arcade\"\n- Make sure it actually works and is fun to play\n\nDO NOT message Doug or deliver anything. Just build it and start the server. The cron job will handle delivery."}],"timestamp":1770002908855}}
{"type":"message","id":"260f2815","parentId":"2e5aa9f6","timestamp":"2026-02-02T03:28:31.877Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me build this arcade game collection.","thinkingSignature":"EtEBCkYICxgCKkBUUMyFBAcfDPR8nCtfLihFVBJXVmVPTEemZP3Rf9vbKkYxUD3nyyy1DVLKtZfOldhHGkYKMusVzOKxm8P+CWYSEgweHV7xVKYdObXcPkQaDH9ePKNKmJbXCfEvSSIw0zhKVepn7E2oL688kSNVPjJvGkXwojdRDjkkMMjvBOchbOQWNOSBTu9KeP3HGmyaKjm5yS4TBQ+0R56rdmObHjQovZgWMWYZ9t+wvwA9n3sLjghPO0zNzq+kas9dLUCv0ASCSvBQ9eNguwQYAQ=="},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01L2dFkgNmvh9xicgBBH212V","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/morning-arcade"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":3,"output":93,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":9631,"totalTokens":9727,"cost":{"input":0.000015000000000000002,"output":0.0023250000000000002,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.060193750000000004,"total":0.06253375}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770002908856}}
{"type":"message","id":"c833640f","parentId":"260f2815","timestamp":"2026-02-02T03:28:31.905Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01L2dFkgNmvh9xicgBBH212V","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":41,"aggregated":"","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770002911903}}
{"type":"message","id":"548aa0c2","parentId":"c833640f","timestamp":"2026-02-02T03:30:11.272Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01AszMRVoEKPi2D3Q4iF5Voq","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/morning-arcade/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Doug's Sunday Morning Arcade</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  background: #0a0a0a;\n  color: #00ff41;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n/* CRT effect */\nbody::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n  background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n    0deg,\n    rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0px,\n    rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 1px,\n    transparent 1px,\n    transparent 3px\n  );\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 9999;\n}\nbody::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 100%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 9998;\n}\n\n.screen { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; position: relative; }\nh1 { text-align: center; color: #ff00ff; font-size: 1.4em; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff, 0 0 20px #ff00ff; margin: 20px 0; line-height: 1.6; }\nh2 { color: #00ffff; font-size: 1em; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ffff; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center; }\n.subtitle { text-align: center; color: #ffff00; font-size: 0.6em; margin-bottom: 30px; text-shadow: 0 0 6px #ffff00; }\n\n/* Menu */\n.menu { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; align-items: center; margin: 30px 0; }\n.menu-btn {\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.8em;\n  padding: 18px 30px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 3px solid;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  width: 340px;\n  text-align: center;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px currentColor;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.menu-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }\n.btn-react { color: #ff4444; border-color: #ff4444; }\n.btn-react:hover { background: rgba(255,68,68,0.15); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,68,68,0.4); }\n.btn-snake { color: #00ff41; border-color: #00ff41; }\n.btn-snake:hover { background: rgba(0,255,65,0.15); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,255,65,0.4); }\n.btn-trivia { color: #ffff00; border-color: #ffff00; }\n.btn-trivia:hover { background: rgba(255,255,0,0.15); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,0,0.4); }\n.btn-back { color: #888; border-color: #888; font-size: 0.6em; padding: 12px 20px; width: auto; margin-top: 20px; }\n.btn-back:hover { color: #fff; border-color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n\n.game-section { display: none; }\n.game-section.active { display: block; }\n\n/* Coin insert animation */\n.coin-overlay {\n  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 5000;\n  animation: fadeIn 0.3s;\n}\n@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.coin {\n  width: 60px; height: 60px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, #ffdd00, #cc8800);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 4px solid #ffaa00;\n  animation: coinDrop 0.8s ease-in forwards;\n  font-size: 30px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n@keyframes coinDrop {\n  0% { transform: translateY(-200px) rotate(0deg); opacity: 0; }\n  60% { transform: translateY(20px) rotate(360deg); opacity: 1; }\n  80% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(380deg); }\n  100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(360deg); opacity: 1; }\n}\n.coin-text { color: #ffdd00; font-size: 0.7em; margin-top: 20px; animation: blink 0.5s infinite; }\n@keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }\n\n/* Reaction game */\n#react-area {\n  width: 100%; height: 400px;\n  background: #111;\n  border: 2px solid #ff4444;\n  position: relative;\n  cursor: crosshair;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.target {\n  position: absolute;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, #ff0, #f00);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  animation: pulse 0.4s infinite alternate;\n}\n@keyframes pulse { to { box-shadow: 0 0 30px #ff0, 0 0 60px #f00; transform: scale(1.1); } }\n.stats { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 0.6em; color: #ff4444; }\n\n/* Snake game */\n#snake-canvas {\n  display: block;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  border: 2px solid #00ff41;\n  background: #0a0a0a;\n}\n.snake-info { text-align: center; font-size: 0.6em; color: #00ff41; margin: 10px 0; }\n.mobile-controls { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 5px; margin-top: 15px; }\n.mobile-controls .row { display: flex; gap: 5px; }\n.ctrl-btn {\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  width: 50px; height: 50px;\n  background: rgba(0,255,65,0.1);\n  border: 2px solid #00ff41;\n  color: #00ff41;\n  font-size: 1.2em;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n.ctrl-btn:active { background: rgba(0,255,65,0.3); }\n\n/* Trivia */\n.trivia-q {\n  background: #111;\n  border: 2px solid #ffff00;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin: 15px 0;\n  font-size: 0.7em;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: #ffff00;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.trivia-opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin: 15px 0; }\n.trivia-opt {\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.6em;\n  padding: 14px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 2px solid #ffff00;\n  color: #ffff00;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-align: left;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n.trivia-opt:hover { background: rgba(255,255,0,0.1); }\n.trivia-opt.correct { border-color: #00ff41; color: #00ff41; background: rgba(0,255,65,0.15); }\n.trivia-opt.wrong { border-color: #ff4444; color: #ff4444; background: rgba(255,68,68,0.15); }\n.trivia-score { text-align: center; font-size: 0.7em; color: #ffff00; margin: 10px 0; }\n\n.high-scores { text-align: center; color: #ff00ff; font-size: 0.55em; margin: 20px 0; line-height: 2; }\n\n/* Flicker effect on title */\n.flicker { animation: flicker 3s infinite; }\n@keyframes flicker {\n  0%, 19%, 21%, 23%, 25%, 54%, 56%, 100% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff, 0 0 20px #ff00ff, 0 0 40px #ff00ff; }\n  20%, 24%, 55% { text-shadow: none; }\n}\n\n.result-screen { text-align: center; padding: 30px 0; }\n.result-screen .big { font-size: 1.2em; margin: 20px 0; }\n.result-screen .detail { font-size: 0.6em; line-height: 2; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"screen\">\n  <!-- MENU -->\n  <div id=\"menu\" class=\"game-section active\">\n    <h1 class=\"flicker\">🕹️ DOUG'S<br>SUNDAY MORNING<br>ARCADE 🕹️</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">~ INSERT COIN TO PLAY ~</p>\n    <div class=\"menu\">\n      <button class=\"menu-btn btn-react\" onclick=\"startGame('react')\">⚡ QUICK DRAW<br><span style=\"font-size:0.6em\">Reaction Speed Test</span></button>\n      <button class=\"menu-btn btn-snake\" onclick=\"startGame('snake')\">🐍 SNAKE ATTACK<br><span style=\"font-size:0.6em\">Classic Arcade Action</span></button>\n      <button class=\"menu-btn btn-trivia\" onclick=\"startGame('trivia')\">🧠 WEIRD TRIVIA<br><span style=\"font-size:0.6em\">Strange But True</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"high-scores\" id=\"highScores\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- REACTION GAME -->\n  <div id=\"react-game\" class=\"game-section\">\n    <h2>⚡ QUICK DRAW ⚡</h2>\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <span>ROUND: <span id=\"react-round\">0</span>/10</span>\n      <span>AVG: <span id=\"react-avg\">---</span>ms</span>\n      <span>BEST: <span id=\"react-best\">---</span>ms</span>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"react-area\"></div>\n    <p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:0.5em;margin-top:10px;color:#888\">Click the targets as fast as you can!</p>\n    <button class=\"menu-btn btn-back\" onclick=\"showMenu()\">← BACK</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- SNAKE GAME -->\n  <div id=\"snake-game\" class=\"game-section\">\n    <h2>🐍 SNAKE ATTACK 🐍</h2>\n    <div class=\"snake-info\">SCORE: <span id=\"snake-score\">0</span> | HIGH: <span id=\"snake-high\">0</span></div>\n    <canvas id=\"snake-canvas\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"snake-info\" id=\"snake-msg\">Arrow keys or WASD to move. Tap controls below on mobile.</div>\n    <div class=\"mobile-controls\">\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"setDir(0,-1)\">▲</button></div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"setDir(-1,0)\">◄</button>\n        <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"setDir(0,1)\">▼</button>\n        <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"setDir(1,0)\">►</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"menu-btn btn-back\" onclick=\"stopSnake();showMenu()\">← BACK</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- TRIVIA GAME -->\n  <div id=\"trivia-game\" class=\"game-section\">\n    <h2>🧠 WEIRD TRIVIA 🧠</h2>\n    <div class=\"trivia-score\">QUESTION <span id=\"triv-num\">1</span>/10 | SCORE: <span id=\"triv-score\">0</span></div>\n    <div class=\"trivia-q\" id=\"triv-question\"></div>\n    <div class=\"trivia-opts\" id=\"triv-opts\"></div>\n    <button class=\"menu-btn btn-back\" onclick=\"showMenu()\">← BACK</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RESULT SCREEN -->\n  <div id=\"result-screen\" class=\"game-section\">\n    <div class=\"result-screen\" id=\"result-content\"></div>\n    <button class=\"menu-btn btn-back\" onclick=\"showMenu()\">← BACK TO ARCADE</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// --- UTILITIES ---\nfunction show(id) { document.querySelectorAll('.game-section').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active')); document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active'); }\nfunction showMenu() { show('menu'); updateHighScores(); }\n\nfunction coinInsert(cb) {\n  const ov = document.createElement('div');\n  ov.className = 'coin-overlay';\n  ov.innerHTML = '<div class=\"coin\">$</div><div class=\"coin-text\">INSERT COIN</div>';\n  document.body.appendChild(ov);\n  // Coin sound simulation with Web Audio\n  try {\n    const ac = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();\n    const o = ac.createOscillator(); const g = ac.createGain();\n    o.connect(g); g.connect(ac.destination);\n    o.frequency.setValueAtTime(800, ac.currentTime);\n    o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(1200, ac.currentTime + 0.1);\n    o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(600, ac.currentTime + 0.2);\n    g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.15, ac.currentTime);\n    g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, ac.currentTime + 0.3);\n    o.start(); o.stop(ac.currentTime + 0.3);\n  } catch(e) {}\n  setTimeout(() => { ov.remove(); cb(); }, 1200);\n}\n\n// High scores from localStorage\nfunction getHS(key) { return parseInt(localStorage.getItem('arcade_'+key) || '0'); }\nfunction setHS(key, val) { const old = getHS(key); if (key === 'react') { if (old === 0 || val < old) localStorage.setItem('arcade_'+key, val); } else { if (val > old) localStorage.setItem('arcade_'+key, val); } }\nfunction updateHighScores() {\n  const r = getHS('react'), s = getHS('snake'), t = getHS('trivia');\n  let html = '── HIGH SCORES ──<br>';\n  if (r) html += `⚡ Quick Draw: ${r}ms avg<br>`;\n  if (s) html += `🐍 Snake: ${s} pts<br>`;\n  if (t) html += `🧠 Trivia: ${t}/10<br>`;\n  if (!r && !s && !t) html += 'No scores yet!<br>';\n  document.getElementById('highScores').innerHTML = html;\n}\nupdateHighScores();\n\nfunction startGame(g) { coinInsert(() => { if (g==='react') initReact(); else if (g==='snake') initSnake(); else initTrivia(); }); }\n\n// --- REACTION GAME ---\nlet reactRound, reactTimes, reactTimeout;\nfunction initReact() {\n  show('react-game');\n  reactRound = 0; reactTimes = [];\n  document.getElementById('react-round').textContent = '0';\n  document.getElementById('react-avg').textContent = '---';\n  document.getElementById('react-best').textContent = '---';\n  document.getElementById('react-area').innerHTML = '';\n  spawnTarget();\n}\nfunction spawnTarget() {\n  if (reactRound >= 10) return finishReact();\n  const area = document.getElementById('react-area');\n  area.innerHTML = '';\n  const delay = 400 + Math.random() * 1500;\n  reactTimeout = setTimeout(() => {\n    const size = 30 + Math.random() * 30;\n    const t = document.createElement('div');\n    t.className = 'target';\n    t.style.width = t.style.height = size + 'px';\n    t.style.left = Math.random() * (area.clientWidth - size) + 'px';\n    t.style.top = Math.random() * (area.clientHeight - size) + 'px';\n    const start = performance.now();\n    t.onclick = () => {\n      const ms = Math.round(performance.now() - start);\n      reactTimes.push(ms);\n      reactRound++;\n      document.getElementById('react-round').textContent = reactRound;\n      const avg = Math.round(reactTimes.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/reactTimes.length);\n      const best = Math.min(...reactTimes);\n      document.getElementById('react-avg').textContent = avg;\n      document.getElementById('react-best').textContent = best;\n      // Flash\n      t.style.background = '#00ff41'; t.style.boxShadow = '0 0 30px #00ff41';\n      setTimeout(spawnTarget, 300);\n    };\n    area.appendChild(t);\n  }, delay);\n}\nfunction finishReact() {\n  clearTimeout(reactTimeout);\n  const avg = Math.round(reactTimes.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/reactTimes.length);\n  const best = Math.min(...reactTimes);\n  setHS('react', avg);\n  let rank = avg < 250 ? '🏆 LEGENDARY' : avg < 350 ? '⚡ LIGHTNING' : avg < 500 ? '👍 SOLID' : '🐌 SLEEPY';\n  show('result-screen');\n  document.getElementById('result-content').innerHTML = `\n    <h2 style=\"color:#ff4444\">⚡ QUICK DRAW RESULTS ⚡</h2>\n    <div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#ff4444\">${avg}ms AVG</div>\n    <div class=\"detail\" style=\"color:#ff8888\">Best: ${best}ms<br>Rating: ${rank}<br><br>\n    ${avg < 300 ? \"Dude, you're FAST. Arcade legend status.\" : \"Not bad for a Sunday morning! ☕\"}</div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// --- SNAKE GAME ---\nconst GRID = 20, CELL = 20;\nlet snake, food, dir, nextDir, snakeScore, snakeInterval, snakeRunning = false;\nfunction initSnake() {\n  show('snake-game');\n  snake = [{x:10,y:10},{x:9,y:10},{x:8,y:10}];\n  dir = {x:1,y:0}; nextDir = {x:1,y:0};\n  snakeScore = 0;\n  document.getElementById('snake-score').textContent = '0';\n  document.getElementById('snake-high').textContent = getHS('snake');\n  document.getElementById('snake-msg').textContent = 'Arrow keys or WASD. Go!';\n  placeFood();\n  snakeRunning = true;\n  if (snakeInterval) clearInterval(snakeInterval);\n  snakeInterval = setInterval(snakeTick, 120);\n  drawSnake();\n}\nfunction placeFood() {\n  do { food = {x: Math.floor(Math.random()*GRID), y: Math.floor(Math.random()*GRID)}; }\n  while (snake.some(s => s.x===food.x && s.y===food.y));\n}\nfunction setDir(x,y) {\n  if (x === -dir.x && y === 0 && dir.y === 0) return;\n  if (y === -dir.y && x === 0 && dir.x === 0) return;\n  nextDir = {x,y};\n}\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n  const map = {ArrowUp:[0,-1],ArrowDown:[0,1],ArrowLeft:[-1,0],ArrowRight:[1,0],w:[0,-1],s:[0,1],a:[-1,0],d:[1,0]};\n  const d = map[e.key];\n  if (d) { e.preventDefault(); setDir(d[0],d[1]); }\n});\nfunction snakeTick() {\n  if (!snakeRunning) return;\n  dir = {...nextDir};\n  const head = {x: snake[0].x + dir.x, y: snake[0].y + dir.y};\n  if (head.x < 0 || head.x >= GRID || head.y < 0 || head.y >= GRID || snake.some(s => s.x===head.x && s.y===head.y)) {\n    snakeRunning = false;\n    clearInterval(snakeInterval);\n    setHS('snake', snakeScore);\n    document.getElementById('snake-msg').textContent = 'GAME OVER! Score: ' + snakeScore;\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      show('result-screen');\n      const msgs = snakeScore > 15 ? \"Snake MASTER! 🐍👑\" : snakeScore > 8 ? \"Solid run, arcade warrior!\" : \"The snake demands more practice!\";\n      document.getElementById('result-content').innerHTML = `\n        <h2 style=\"color:#00ff41\">🐍 SNAKE RESULTS 🐍</h2>\n        <div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#00ff41\">${snakeScore} POINTS</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\" style=\"color:#88ff88\">${msgs}</div>\n      `;\n    }, 1000);\n    return;\n  }\n  snake.unshift(head);\n  if (head.x === food.x && head.y === food.y) {\n    snakeScore++;\n    document.getElementById('snake-score').textContent = snakeScore;\n    placeFood();\n    try {\n      const ac = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();\n      const o = ac.createOscillator(); const g = ac.createGain();\n      o.connect(g); g.connect(ac.destination);\n      o.frequency.value = 600; g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.1, ac.currentTime);\n      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, ac.currentTime + 0.1);\n      o.start(); o.stop(ac.currentTime + 0.1);\n    } catch(e) {}\n  } else { snake.pop(); }\n  drawSnake();\n}\nfunction drawSnake() {\n  const c = document.getElementById('snake-canvas'), ctx = c.getContext('2d');\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#0a0a0a'; ctx.fillRect(0,0,c.width,c.height);\n  // Grid lines\n  ctx.strokeStyle = '#1a1a1a';\n  for (let i=0;i<=GRID;i++) { ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(i*CELL,0); ctx.lineTo(i*CELL,GRID*CELL); ctx.stroke(); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0,i*CELL); ctx.lineTo(GRID*CELL,i*CELL); ctx.stroke(); }\n  // Food\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#ff4444'; ctx.shadowColor = '#ff4444'; ctx.shadowBlur = 10;\n  ctx.fillRect(food.x*CELL+2, food.y*CELL+2, CELL-4, CELL-4);\n  // Snake\n  ctx.shadowColor = '#00ff41'; ctx.shadowBlur = 8;\n  snake.forEach((s,i) => {\n    ctx.fillStyle = i===0 ? '#00ff41' : '#00cc33';\n    ctx.fillRect(s.x*CELL+1, s.y*CELL+1, CELL-2, CELL-2);\n  });\n  ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n}\nfunction stopSnake() { snakeRunning = false; clearInterval(snakeInterval); }\n\n// --- TRIVIA GAME ---\nconst triviaData = [\n  {q:\"A group of flamingos is called a...\",a:[\"Flamboyance\",\"Flock\",\"Flutter\",\"Fandango\"],c:0},\n  {q:\"How many hearts does an octopus have?\",a:[\"1\",\"2\",\"3\",\"8\"],c:2},\n  {q:\"What color is a hippo's sweat?\",a:[\"Clear\",\"Yellow\",\"Red/Pink\",\"Blue\"],c:2},\n  {q:\"Honey never spoils. Edible honey was found in tombs over how many years old?\",a:[\"500\",\"1,000\",\"3,000\",\"10,000\"],c:2},\n  {q:\"A jiffy is an actual unit of time. How long is it?\",a:[\"1/100th of a second\",\"1 millisecond\",\"1/10th of a second\",\"1 nanosecond\"],c:0},\n  {q:\"Which planet rains diamonds?\",a:[\"Mars\",\"Jupiter\",\"Neptune\",\"Venus\"],c:2},\n  {q:\"How many times does the average person walk around the Earth in a lifetime?\",a:[\"1\",\"3\",\"5\",\"10\"],c:2},\n  {q:\"Bananas are technically...\",a:[\"Vegetables\",\"Berries\",\"Nuts\",\"Grasses\"],c:1},\n  {q:\"The shortest war in history lasted how long?\",a:[\"38 minutes\",\"2 hours\",\"1 day\",\"45 seconds\"],c:0},\n  {q:\"What animal can't physically look up at the sky?\",a:[\"Elephant\",\"Pig\",\"Hippo\",\"Turtle\"],c:1},\n  {q:\"Scotland's national animal is...\",a:[\"The Loch Ness Monster\",\"A Unicorn\",\"A Highland Cow\",\"A Dragon\"],c:1},\n  {q:\"How many years old is the oldest known joke?\",a:[\"500\",\"1,900\",\"3,900\",\"100\"],c:2},\n  {q:\"Astronauts grow up to 2 inches taller in space because...\",a:[\"Zero gravity stretches spine\",\"They exercise more\",\"Space food has calcium\",\"Cosmic radiation\"],c:0},\n  {q:\"A snail can sleep for how many years?\",a:[\"1\",\"3\",\"5\",\"10\"],c:1},\n  {q:\"What percentage of the ocean is still unexplored?\",a:[\"50%\",\"65%\",\"80%\",\"95%\"],c:2},\n];\nlet trivQ, trivScore, trivIdx, trivAnswered;\nfunction initTrivia() {\n  show('trivia-game');\n  // Shuffle and pick 10\n  trivQ = triviaData.sort(() => Math.random()-0.5).slice(0,10);\n  trivScore = 0; trivIdx = 0; trivAnswered = false;\n  showTrivia();\n}\nfunction showTrivia() {\n  if (trivIdx >= trivQ.length) return finishTrivia();\n  trivAnswered = false;\n  const q = trivQ[trivIdx];\n  document.getElementById('triv-num').textContent = trivIdx+1;\n  document.getElementById('triv-score').textContent = trivScore;\n  document.getElementById('triv-question').textContent = q.q;\n  const opts = document.getElementById('triv-opts');\n  opts.innerHTML = '';\n  q.a.forEach((a,i) => {\n    const btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.className = 'trivia-opt';\n    btn.textContent = String.fromCharCode(65+i) + '. ' + a;\n    btn.onclick = () => answerTrivia(i);\n    opts.appendChild(btn);\n  });\n}\nfunction answerTrivia(i) {\n  if (trivAnswered) return;\n  trivAnswered = true;\n  const q = trivQ[trivIdx];\n  const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.trivia-opt');\n  btns[q.c].classList.add('correct');\n  if (i === q.c) { trivScore++; document.getElementById('triv-score').textContent = trivScore; }\n  else { btns[i].classList.add('wrong'); }\n  setTimeout(() => { trivIdx++; showTrivia(); }, 1500);\n}\nfunction finishTrivia() {\n  setHS('trivia', trivScore);\n  const msg = trivScore >= 9 ? \"GENIUS! You know ALL the weird stuff! 🧠✨\" : trivScore >= 7 ? \"Impressive! You're a font of random knowledge!\" : trivScore >= 5 ? \"Not bad! You know some weird stuff!\" : \"Time to read more bathroom fact books! 📚\";\n  show('result-screen');\n  document.getElementById('result-content').innerHTML = `\n    <h2 style=\"color:#ffff00\">🧠 TRIVIA RESULTS 🧠</h2>\n    <div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#ffff00\">${trivScore}/10</div>\n    <div class=\"detail\" style=\"color:#ffff88\">${msg}</div>\n  `;\n}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":7984,"cacheRead":9631,"cacheWrite":108,"totalTokens":17724,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.1996,"cacheRead":0.0048154999999999995,"cacheWrite":0.000675,"total":0.20509550000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770002911905}}
